re land is still a legal target for the â€œtarget landâ€ part of the spell. The â€œdestroy target nonblack creatureâ€ part of the spell wonâ€™t affect that permanent, but the â€œdestroy target landâ€ part of the spell will still destroy it. It canâ€™t be regenerated.",
